{"id":"wb-7-613","name":"安阳高陵","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"曹操高陵","text":"曹操高陵，又称安阳高陵、魏高陵、西高穴2号墓，是东汉末年魏王曹操之陵墓。曹操陵墓之所在位置近两千年来一直是个谜团，直至2009年12月27日经由河南省文物局宣布，在曹操高陵考古确认，其地址位于安阳市安阳县安丰乡西高穴村一带。2010年2月4日，以“曹操高陵”的名称增补为第五批河南省文物保护单位。2013年3月5日，以“安阳高陵”的名称公布为第七批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%9B%B9%E6%93%8D%E9%AB%98%E9%99%B5","revisionId":94072422,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94072422","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/224d2bd2bc6f8b467b3bbf49.jpg","title":"20250913_Gao_Mausoleum_of_Cao_Cao_05.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20250913_Gao_Mausoleum_of_Cao_Cao_05.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/52/20250913_Gao_Mausoleum_of_Cao_Cao_05.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​安阳高陵（曹操墓） 墓道入口","width":320,"height":213}}